# Committed DEFAULT palette (neutral dark). This is just a baseline so
# the repo renders standalone. When matugen is installed, apply.sh's
# generate_palette OVERWRITES this file with a Material You palette
# extracted from ~/.config/hypr/wallpapers/default.* — so edit the
# WALLPAPER to reskin, not this file.

